  "bio": "Discover the artistry of Eco Tattoo London, a serene oasis nestled in the vibrant heart of London at 186 Royal College Street, NW1 9NN. Specializing in stunning watercolor, elegant minimalist, and timeless black & gray tattoos, this studio welcomes you into an eco-conscious and creative space where your skin becomes the canvas for exquisite, personalized ink. Connect with us at 07399442272 or ecotattoouk@hotmail.com for a consultation, and embrace the unique tattoo experience we offer.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom"
